		(property "Description" "Panasonic AXK680337YG -- P5K series 0.5mm-pitch 80-pin board-to-board HEADER, 3.0mm mated height, with positioning bosses (carrier-board side; mates with the ALINX AC7200 module's own AXK580137YG sockets (module-side part number CONFIRMED via ALINX's real schematic, docs/AC7200_Schematic.pdf page 12 -- see ../../AXK580137YG/KiCad/AXK580137YG.kicad_sym's own Description) -- see ../../AC7200/AC7200_README.md). Real dimensions from Panasonic/Mouser's own P5K/P5KS catalog PDF (mouser.com/catalog/specsheets/AXK.pdf), read directly, not web-summarized: body 23.20 x 4.60mm, 0.5mm pitch, 40 pins/row x 2 rows staggered by 0.25mm (half pitch), 5.60mm total footprint span. Generic connector, no per-pin signal names (pins numbered 1-80 sequentially by row, an assumed labeling convention -- NOT independently verified against a real pin-1 diagram in the catalog; the catalog does show a chamfered-corner orientation key on the connector body, reproduced on the footprint's silkscreen)."
